note S4 export (spec 6): two exports and a private helper. Words 0 and 1 are B to inc and dbl (source
note order); helper is a private function called by inc (bytes pinned).
om2
fn helper a ulong to ulong
ret add a 1
end
export fn inc a ulong to ulong
ret helper a
end
export fn dbl a ulong to ulong
ret mul a 2
end
